# oracle: pair_modify compute no with tail yes on lj/cut (the tail term is an energy of the pair term)
units lj
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 0.8442
region box block 0 5 0 5 0 5
create_box 2 box
create_atoms 1 box
mass * 1.0
set group all type/fraction 2 0.3 1234
pair_style lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff * * 1.0 1.0
pair_modify compute no tail yes
thermo_style custom step pe evdwl etail press
thermo_modify format float %.15g
run 0
